{
  "movie_id": 506400601,
  "subtitles": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start_time": 1.6,
      "end_time": 6.8,
      "text": "♪精一杯の想い全部伝えたい～"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start_time": 7.0,
      "end_time": 10.0,
      "text": "♪こんな気持ちはじめてだよ"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start_time": 15.8,
      "end_time": 18.0,
      "text": "Bumoaaahh--!"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start_time": 20.6,
      "end_time": 21.8,
      "text": "And now, Chloe-kun..."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start_time": 22.0,
      "end_time": 26.8,
      "text": "Those monsters are currently wreaking havoc at the ongoing live performance."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start_time": 27.0,
      "end_time": 30.2,
      "text": "For us, could this be a convenient turn of events in some sense?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start_time": 31.0,
      "end_time": 32.6,
      "text": "A great idea!"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start_time": 33.8,
      "end_time": 35.4,
      "text": "Well, not really..."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start_time": 35.8,
      "end_time": 36.8,
      "text": "I thought so."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start_time": 37.2,
      "end_time": 38.8,
      "text": "Of course it is!"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start_time": 41.0,
      "end_time": 41.8,
      "text": "Jump!"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start_time": 42.2,
      "end_time": 43.0,
      "text": "Landing!"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start_time": 43.8,
      "end_time": 46.0,
      "text": "Pesky fans interfering with Nozomin performance..."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start_time": 49.2,
      "end_time": 50.0,
      "text": "Hah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start_time": 52.8,
      "end_time": 55.0,
      "text": "Chieru will eliminate them with full force!"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start_time": 55.8,
      "end_time": 57.2,
      "text": "Alright, let's go, everyone!"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start_time": 57.4,
      "end_time": 59.8,
      "text": "Yuni-chan will protect the peace of the school!"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start_time": 60.2,
      "end_time": 64.0,
      "text": "That's right! The peace of the school is protected by Friendship Club!"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start_time": 64.4,
      "end_time": 65.6,
      "text": "S-So cool..."
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start_time": 65.8,
      "end_time": 69.4,
      "text": "For our sake... as expected of Friendship Club, everyone!"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start_time": 72.6,
      "end_time": 75.2,
      "text": "(Before our involvement with them is exposed──)"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start_time": 76.0,
      "end_time": 79.0,
      "text": "(Before this troublesome commotion is revealed to the student council──)"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start_time": 79.8,
      "end_time": 81.6,
      "text": "(To be honest, for the scholarship──)"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start_time": 81.8,
      "end_time": 83.2,
      "text": "Let's crush them in no time!"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start_time": 89.8,
      "end_time": 92.4,
      "text": "...Huh? Weren't they like that before, the enemies?"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start_time": 92.8,
      "end_time": 97.6,
      "text": "Haha, it's funny. In the short time we looked away, Koni-chan's has really grown."
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start_time": 98.0,
      "end_time": 103.0,
      "text": "I see, they're combining and transforming... It's a development I've seen somewhere before."
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start_time": 104.0,
      "end_time": 107.0,
      "text": "Well, if they're all grouped together..."
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start_time": 108.0,
      "end_time": 110.0,
      "text": "That's a pretty clever move too."
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start_time": 110.4,
      "end_time": 112.0,
      "text": "Absolutely, let's move quickly!"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start_time": 113.8,
      "end_time": 118.8,
      "text": "Before someone from the student council arrives, let's dispose of them promptly──"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start_time": 125.6,
      "end_time": 126.8,
      "text": "...Eh?"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start_time": 130.8,
      "end_time": 133.0,
      "text": "Aaaaah!?"
    }
  ],
